  },
  {
   "id": 230,
   "en": "Japan - Sapporo Outskirts",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 231,
   "en": "Shiun Residence - Living Room",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 232,
   "en": "Jinpu",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 233,
   "en": "I see... I get the situation.@Sounds like you've been through a lot.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 234,
   "en": "So, about that Granteed machine...@What should we do with it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 235,
   "en": "There was fighting in the middle of town, so@you've got no choice but to hand it over to the@<Earth Federation Army>. You did notify them, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 236,
   "en": "Yes.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 237,
   "en": "Still, it's strange.@You'd think the Chitose unit would've@rushed over before it was all over.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 238,
   "en": "There were comm and network outages around here...@no, over an even wider area, so maybe that's why.@The airport must've been in chaos too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "Well, at least we can talk now.@Anyway, wait for the Federation Army to show up@and hand over this Granteed thing.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "Um, should I... Should Katia and Melua@and I go with it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "Let's see... They'll probably question you,@but running off to avoid it or trying to hide@something would be a bad idea.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
   "en": "(Hide something...?@I don't know anything, so how could I?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 243,
   "en": "Katia",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 244,
   "en": "They might... interrogate us, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 245,
   "en": "Melua",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 246,
   "en": "Huh...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "Don't worry. I won't let 'em try anything funny.@I know a few people in the Far East Command.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "Then I'm counting on you.@Akimi, Akemi, I'll arrange for the Soul Saber's@recovery on my end. Sit tight there for a while.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "Got it, Jinpu.@By the way, how's Dad doing?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "Yeah, I got through to him a bit ago.@Sounds like things are a mess on his end too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "I see... I hope he's okay.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "Leave the offshore plant to the president.@Well, I'll be in touch later.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "The military guys might be here any minute.@Shoko and I'll wait in the Kaiser.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "Yeah, got it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "Let's go, Shoko.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "Okay, big brother.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "...Hey, Akimi. Is that robot the reason@you two have been so busy?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "Yeah... It's the Soul Saber, a <Mighty Walker>@developed by <Mogami Heavy Industries>.@Basically, a prototype mass-production super robot.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "I can't believe you and Akemi were its pilots...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "I've wanted to pilot a robot since I was little.@So I talked my old man into it, to show that@this thing was easy to handle...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "To put it bluntly, I volunteered as a test pilot@to prove to the client that with training, even@high schoolers like us could pilot it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "The client... You mean the Earth Federation Army?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "That's right.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "That's why we kept it a secret. I'm sorry.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "Oh, no, that's fine.@I'm just surprised you two were riding@in something like that and fighting...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "That sound... Is the Federation unit here?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "We should go too.@Touya, you guys stay here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "Y-Yeah...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "So, Jinpu.@About that Granteed machine...@What should we do with it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "Got it, Jinpu.@By the way, how's Dad doing?@Did you get through to the offshore plant?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "Yeah, a bit ago.@Sounds like things are a mess on his end too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "The military guys might be here any minute.@Shoko and I'll wait outside.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "...Hey, Akimi. Is that robot the product@you were talking about?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "The Soul Saber is a power, a tool,@for defending the Earth Sphere.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "...But it's a weapon, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Yeah... No matter how you phrase it or dress it up,@that fact doesn't change. I know that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "But there are people who'll attack, like before.@I don't want to just run away, helpless,@like during the <Shura Revolt>...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "So they finally showed up.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "Federation Soldier",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "Those guys... Sure, we were late, but they@wiped out the enemy before we even arrived.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "Captain...@Two of the three units don't match any data.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "Right. Command may already know about this,@but we'll secure the scene anyway. All units, at once...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "Captain?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "What the heck? They're flying all wobbly.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "Yeah, something's really off...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "Let's try contacting 'em. I'm getting in the Kaiser.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "Roa",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "...Kota, don't let them get close.@Get ready to intercept.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Huh? Why?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "I scanned those machines with the Kaiser Scanner.@There's a strange reading. Most likely, this is...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "Is what?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "It's the ones from that time. Brace yourself!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "Y-Yeah.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "Th-They're shooting at us!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "Wh-Why?! Aren't they the Federation Army?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "It's just like that time...@The pilots are most likely being controlled.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "What's that supposed to mean?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "Just intercept them!@They'll attack without the slightest hesitation!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "O-Okay, fine!@Akimi, Akemi, take Touya and the others@and get out of here in the Soul Saber!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "R-Right!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "Roa, the ones controlling the Federation units...@They're the ones who attacked Shoko and the others@before <The Sealing War>...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "Yes, no doubt about it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "Akimi, three people won't fit in the cockpit.@Let's have them ride in the palm of its hand.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "Akimi, are you listening?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "...Akemi,@check the FCS on your end too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "You're going to fight?!@There are Federation soldiers inside@those <Armored Module>s!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "I know... I know that!@But if we don't stop them somehow, our town will...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "What're you doing, Akimi?! Get outta here!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "This is my town. I'm fighting too!@We just have to immobilize the Federation units, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "It ain't that simple!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "...Kota, their target is the Kaiser.@That means we can lure them.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "They're after the Kaiser...?@Wait... Right, now I remember!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "The one controlling those <Armored Module>s@is <That Amoeba Guy>!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "Yes. That's why it's better to have support.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "I can handle those guys by myself!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "That time,@they latched onto the Kaiser and controlled it.@And then, a dimensional door opened...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "And we were sent flying to another world.@Have you forgotten that?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "We can't let them approach or make contact.@And we have to disable their machines@without harming the pilots.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "This is a difficult mission.@To minimize damage to the town too,@we should borrow Akimi's strength here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "But those two still...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "We managed against the <Zovorg>, didn't we?@Let me help too. If I take out their <Tesla Drive>s@just right, that should stop them, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "...Fine.@But don't go charging in carelessly.@Touya and the others are with you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "Yeah. Ready, Akemi?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "Don't do anything reckless.@We're only test pilots, after all.@Don't count on your luck holding forever.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "I know!@Touya, you guys get out of there!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "Y-You're fighting again, Akimi...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "Yeah, I'm the Soul Saber's pilot!@I can't run away now!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "Don't worry, we'll protect your house@and the Granteed! So get going!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "...O-Okay!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "(There's nothing I can do against those...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "(I don't understand any of this... and Dad's dead...@I can't do it...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "Kota, Akimi, don't let them get adjacent to you.@They could infect your machines.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "So we keep from gettin' close to 'em by accident@and knock 'em out of action, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "Right. Use ranged weapons as much as possible.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "Damn it! The machine won't move!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "It's only latched on, so it's temporary.@But if this goes on, we'll be infected.@Once we can move again, shake it off fast.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "Y-Yeah!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "Aah, the machine!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "D-Damn it! The machine won't move!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "R-roger!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "W-We somehow pulled it off...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "All Federation units have stopped...@and the pilots show vital signs.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "What about the amoeba guys hangin' on 'em?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "No sign of them.@They seem to have vanished once the machines@were disabled.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "I figured they'd merge into one@and come after the Kaiser...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "And no gate opened like that time, either.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "Who the heck are those things?@Where are they comin' from...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "...Sorry for all the trouble, Kota.@And thank you for saving the pilots.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "I dunno why the amoeba guys showed up@again after all this time...@but they're still after the Kaiser.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "Then it's dangerous to keep@the Compatible Kaiser in the city.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "Yeah, I know that.@Should I head back to Mogami Heavy Industries'@test site for now?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "No, could you head to Yakumo Base@on the Oshima Peninsula?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "Not Chitose?@I heard that's the closest base.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "For certain reasons, we of the <Special Tactics@Instructor Unit> are heading toward Shakotan@Peninsula. Yakumo is along our route.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "What reasons?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "That's classified. I can't say.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "Fine, whatever.@So if I go to this Yakumo place,@it'll be easy to meet up with you guys?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "Exactly.@Can you also transport that Granteed@machine to Yakumo Base?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 361,
   "en": "Yeah, if I carry it with the Kaiser.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 362,
   "en": "Um, Major Kai...@What should we do about Touya, Katia,@and Melua?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 363,
   "en": "We'll need to hear their story. Bring them along.@The <Mogami Heavy Industries> test pilots too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 364,
   "en": "Wait, Soul Saber and all?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 365,
   "en": "Yes.@We can't leave just one machine there.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 366,
   "en": "That's gonna be rough... but if they fire their@verniers from below, I guess I can manage.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 367,
   "en": "And one more thing...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 368,
   "en": "Shiun Residence - Touya's Room",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 369,
   "en": "Yakumo... Base?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 370,
   "en": "Yeah.@It's a bit far, but we're headin' there now.@All of us here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 371,
   "en": "So that means Dad too...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 372,
   "en": "Yup.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 373,
   "en": "...Okay. We can't just leave him@lying here forever...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 374,
   "en": "(Touya...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 375,
   "en": "(Will Dad and I... ever come back to this house...?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 376,
   "en": "Hey, Akimi...@Those <Armored Module>s earlier...@there were people inside them...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 377,
   "en": "Yeah... I'm glad nobody died.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 378,
   "en": "But we might have@gotten someone killed.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 379,
   "en": "...I know.@That's what going into real combat means...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 380,
   "en": "I just didn't want aliens and monsters@wrecking our town...@That was all I could think about, but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 381,
   "en": "Yeah... Now it's starting to scare me...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 382,
   "en": "(And that's not all...@If we keep on fighting like this,@someday we might...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  }
 ]
}